# Design anti-slop

- Read `DESIGN.md` or `templates/DESIGN.md` before changing look-and-feel.
- Do not restyle Mini App / console toward Inter + purple/indigo + `gray-800` + `blue-500`.
- Extend existing brand tokens; do not introduce a second palette “because Tailwind”.
- Marketing-template heroes (3 feature cards, generic AI gradient) are out of scope for ASF chrome.
- Full checklist: `.cursor/skills/anti-slop-design/SKILL.md`.
